  "known_limitations": [
    "Trained on a single dataset of 1,273 laptops listed around 2017-2018 (Intel 6th-8th gen, GTX 10-series era); prices of newer hardware (e.g. Intel 10th gen+, Ryzen 5000+, RTX GPUs, Apple Silicon) are extrapolations.",
    "Prices shrink towards the middle: budget laptops are over-predicted (~ -11% mean signed error) and laptops above Rs 100k under-predicted (~ +12%); errors are largest for very expensive and workstation laptops.",
    "Typical error is about 12% (median absolute percentage error on the holdout); identical configurations in the data already differ in price by about 4%, so no model can be exact.",
    "Any CPU that does not start with 'Intel' is encoded as 'AMD Processor' (true in the training data, not for e.g. Apple M-series or Qualcomm).",
    "Companies with fewer than 10 training laptops, and companies never seen in training, are grouped as \"Other\".",
    "Categories unseen in training (e.g. a new TypeName) are encoded as all zeros by the one-hot encoder (drop=\"first\"), which makes them look like the first (dropped) category of that feature.",
    "Flash Storage and Hybrid drives are not used as features; a laptop with only flash storage has SSD=0 and HDD=0.",
    "Currency is the dataset's price unit (Indian rupees)."
  ],
